1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,128
Part eleven. Products and stock.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,881
Open Inventory, then Products.

3
00:00:06,881 --> 00:00:13,634
This is everything you sell or buy: panels, inverters, batteries, structures,

4
00:00:13,634 --> 00:00:17,054
cables, and services like installation.

5
00:00:17,054 --> 00:00:21,088
The list shows the price and what is in stock.

6
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,520
Tap New Product.

7
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,103
Give it a name and a unique SKU code.

8
00:00:27,103 --> 00:00:31,461
Choose the category first: for a solar panel,

9
00:00:31,461 --> 00:00:36,497
GST becomes five percent and the HSN 8541 by itself.

10
00:00:36,497 --> 00:00:42,696
Batteries, structures, cables and services get eighteen percent.

11
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:49,755
Add the brand and specification, the sale price and the purchase cost before GST,

12
00:00:49,755 --> 00:00:53,549
and the level at which you want a low-stock alert.

13
00:00:53,549 --> 00:00:53,928
Save.

14
00:00:55,410 --> 00:01:00,187
The stock card shows stock in each warehouse, what is on order,

15
00:01:00,187 --> 00:01:02,992
the average cost and the stock value.

16
00:01:02,992 --> 00:01:07,618
To enter opening stock or a stock count, tap Count or adjust,

17
00:01:07,618 --> 00:01:12,091
choose where you counted, type the quantity and the reason.

18
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:18,866
To send stock to another store, tap Move between warehouses, choose from and to,

19
00:01:18,866 --> 00:01:20,110
and the quantity.

20
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:22,819
It can never move more than is there.

21
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:28,994
Every change is a stock entry with its reason: purchase receipts,

22
00:01:28,994 --> 00:01:33,043
deliveries to site, returns, transfers and counts.

23
00:01:33,043 --> 00:01:37,577
When stock falls to the alert level, it shows in alerts.

24
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:42,779
Next video: Delivery challans: material to site.

